<p><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">As someone who understands the demands of your role, I wanted to reach out and let you know we can help with your fiber, cable, wire, and electrical and communications connectivity product needs.</span></span></p>

